This review replaces the interpretation in the [original incident page](/kb/incidents/4471).
The counts describe the support KB export dated 4 October 2026. A later engineering update on
the course's Challenge page reports that #4471 closed on 5 October, with different outcomes
for the two causes. The historical counts below are retained rather than rewritten as live totals.

## Engineering disposition — 5 October

- **Parser: fixed.** Engineering reports `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`. [Parser ticket](https://github.com/avyin/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1) is closed as completed.
- **Hint: won't fix.** Engineering reports `booking-v3 form retired`. [Form-hint ticket](https://github.com/avyin/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2) is closed as not planned, not as a delivered hint fix.

Source: the [Challenge page's engineering update](https://hq.mega.dev/challenges/what-it-shows),
read on 16 November 2026. These are the desk's reported dispositions; we did not implement or
independently test its product changes. The reproduction and verification criteria below document
the investigation and remain useful if symptoms recur.

